. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cerW1E09E34Q7kNvwFX2_mi&_nc_oc=AdlzNXvic6GEytrfMvcFIeJaS-s5QW-c6vPzobp6QrplGms3H0xH0Bki4IKi5Y8bx04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxNpgw_IV10bEYSlQVFYemww4cc-pHa7fzhp_LEtoyXQ&oe=69A58A3E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RqBfkUdnO0YQ7kNvwG54LSQ&_nc_oc=AdmylNMSmBqZMcuhaty4xTXByOX8drZW-HLpW__Utx2qSHfttr9VjZnaNPCOBtnNX3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvzMZn3_ux_k_OJ4o-Q3rKuVXdpwc7My-lPmXA7SoUDRw&oe=69A5689E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UAbasYQ7b5IQ7kNvwF4v9ZI&_nc_oc=Adk_B_pNQuFbFZfKcVV3pS6DET4qw5LU4QX0YnYY6junmdtMBKW4iYYHl0Wt4aT6U-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfswBydmqoLqhZkqEpCUnOHNZDii7-TYkortt79hivX25g&oe=69A5965B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2